 Built Together, Amazon's $1B commitment to data center communities 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Through Built Together, Amazon is investing more than $1 billion over five years in its data center communities, with residents helping to direct funding towards free college, skilled-trades training, energy efficiency upgrades and the local priorities each community cares about most. 


 
